    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1. You can eat and drink soft drinks during lecture. Be respect to your colleague. \n2. Please be in the lecture. I can not re-teach you again. You should roll-in next semester. \n3. Be active. Negative attitude will only damage you and your relationship with others. \n4. Be helpful. help your classmate and one day they will to the same to you.\n5. You can use mobile.",
